Limn Menu Symbols (limn-backend-lwjgl resources; the one font this repository ships)
  Copyright 2022 The Noto Project Authors (https://github.com/notofonts/)
  SIL Open Font License 1.1: full text in
  limn-backend-lwjgl/src/main/resources/limn/backend/lwjgl/fonts/LimnMenuSymbols-LICENSE.txt
