Mosaic display faces (limn-demo/fonts, the demo only; no library jar carries them)
  Each under the SIL Open Font License 1.1, with the full text beside it in
  limn-demo/fonts/<name>-LICENSE.txt. Every file is pinned by upstream commit and
  verified against a SHA-256 in scripts/fetch-fonts.sh before it lands.

    Comic Neue (Regular, Bold): Copyright (c) 2014 Craig Rozynski
    Inter (variable; the default instance is Regular): Copyright (c) 2016 The Inter
      Project Authors
    Silkscreen (Regular): Copyright (c) 2001 Jason Kottke
    Archivo Black (Regular): Copyright (c) 2011 Omnibus-Type

  They exist for the site's mosaic, which shows one screen under several themes, size
